WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.865 --> 00:00:02.240
JENNY BROWN: Today,
we're talking

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:06.110
about access management, free
skill building, and "Call

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:07.070
of Duty."

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:10.460
I'm Jenny, and welcome to "This
Week in Cloud," where we serve

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.380
you the lowest latency news.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:17.100
To minimize management effort
and the risk of an oversight,

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.360
IT administrators often prefer
centralized access control.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:25.440
To achieve this, we've released
IAM database authentication

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:29.940
for Cloud SQL and MySQL
into general availability.

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:32.130
With IAM database
authentication,

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:35.610
administrators can use cloud
identity and access management

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:39.360
to govern not only
administrative access, but also

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:42.810
connection access for
their MySQL databases.

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:45.720
Check out the blog for more
specifics and how to get

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.280
started.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:50.340
Earlier this year, we launched
the Google Cloud Skills

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.700
Challenge, which provides
30 days of free access

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:57.420
to training to build your cloud
knowledge and an opportunity

00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:00.300
to earn skill badges that
showcase your Google Cloud

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.050
competencies.

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:04.739
Now, we're adding a native
app development track

00:01:04.739 --> 00:01:07.290
to the skills challenge
for cloud developers

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:10.590
who want to learn to build
serverless web apps and Google

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:14.400
Assistant applications on
Google Cloud using Cloud Run

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.440
and Firebase.

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.500
Millions of people view
action-packed esports.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.560
And a new revolutionary
project that we're

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:25.110
working on with Call
of Duty League using

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:29.730
BigQuery and Looker just made
that action a lot better.

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:33.990
ActivStat, an entirely new
capability for esports,

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:36.960
brings fans, players,
and commentators

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:40.710
the power of competitive
statistics in real time.

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:44.460
Call of Duty League will roll
out ActivStat during the 2021

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:45.210
season.

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:48.390
So check out the blog
post for more details.

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:50.880
If you want to read more
about these announcements

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:53.950
or see a full list,
check out the link.

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:55.500
Any thoughts or ideas?

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.460
Leave us a comment or tweet us.

00:01:57.460 --> 00:01:59.690
We'll see you in the cloud.

